{"id":"f2a25f6c61231243","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-marczewski.md","title":"Marczewski Ideal","display":"df-marczewski — Marczewski Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-marczewski","aliases":["58-df-marczewski"],"display":"df-marczewski — Marczewski Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-perfect-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-marczewski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-marczewski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-marczewski — Marczewski Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree\">58-df-zfc-perfect-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^0_0\">\\(s^0_0\\)</span> (Marczewski null ideal defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (tree of finite binary sequences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\)</span> (perfect-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree\">58-df-zfc-perfect-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\">\\([T]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}\\)</span> (body of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski} \\vdash s^0_0\\coloneqq \\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\forall T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq T\\;(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\land [S]\\cap A=\\emptyset))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski} \\vdash s^0_0\\coloneqq \\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\forall T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq T\\;(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\land [S]\\cap A=\\emptyset))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marczewski proved that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^0_0\">\\(s^0_0\\)</span> is an ideal.</li>\n<li>The quantifier ranges over perfect trees; using well-founded trees would make every body empty and the definition vacuous.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-perfect-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-perfect-tree","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)$ (perfect-tree predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-perfect-tree]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s^0_0","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)","display":false},{"tex":"[T]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}marczewski} \\vdash s^0_0\\coloneqq \\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\forall T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\;(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\to\\exists S\\subseteq T\\;(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\land [S]\\cap A=\\emptyset))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"s^0_0","display":false}],"bytes":977,"backlinks":[{"id":"e268cabdd8a38c0b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq2^\\omega$ and $s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md]])."},{"id":"444bd81bf84af2e5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ is the Marczewski null family from [[58-df-marczewski]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-816","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md|58-df-marczewski]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["aba489b7551a80b3"]}